OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 7 DEC
OL,4,G2000FDebussy: Pelleas and Melisande
OL,5,     GA chance to hear more of
OL,6,     Gyesterday's Building a Library
OL,7,     Grecommendation, as well as other
OL,8,     Gnew releases from the week.
OL,9,G2100F20th Century Radicals
OL,10,     GKate Molleson and Gillian Moore
OL,11,     Gshine new light on the 'modern'
OL,12,     Gmusic of the 20th century. This
OL,13,     Gweek, Gillian explores the world
OL,14,     Gof spectralism and the music of
OL,15,     GTristan Murail.
